{"id":"en_zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him","title":"Zero from Him, One Hundred from Him","titleEn":"Zero from Him, One Hundred from Him","description":"Wendy possesses the ability to perceive how much affection others hold for her. After illness caused her to gain weight, her fiancé Henry grew contemptuous and enrolled her at a gym as though she were merely a weight-loss case. There she crossed paths with Luke, a young man she had once encouraged during his childhood. With his assistance she regained her health, and he offered her love without conditions. Wendy ended the engagement and, buoyed by Luke's encouragement, restored her sense of self-worth. Henry came to regret his actions, yet by then nothing could be undone. Wendy and Luke were married. Dramzio is a place where viewers can follow this series.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him/en_US/dfd2b8034987e1af/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Heiress","Tit for Tat","Modern","Woman","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdoii/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdoii/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdoii/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_zero-from-him-one-hundred-from-him_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cdoii/?pub=4occak","kind"